{"id": "EUVD-2026-100485", "enisaUuid": "c5243708-5620-3923-b122-ef26729c528c", "description": "The Okta RADIUS Agent does not validate the sub-attribute length when parsing a Vendor-Specific attribute. A sub-attribute length of zero causes the parser to loop indefinitely, resulting in worker-thread exhaustion and denial of new RADIUS authentication requests.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T20:08:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T15:31:55", "baseScore": 6.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://trust.okta.com/security-advisories/denial-of-service-in-okta-radius-agent-packet-parser-cve-2026-78633"], "aliases": ["GHSA-389c-65cx-g77r", "CVE-2026-78633"], "assigner": "Okta", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ce268d69-c062-3a37-be3c-22bea44780f7", "product": {"name": "Okta RADIUS Agent", "vendor": {"name": "Okta"}}, "product_version": "2.17.5 <2.28.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c5ca25ce-6531-38d7-a593-89d20e26734d", "vendor": {"name": "Okta"}}], "isExploited": false}